#ASSERT `s 218(4) the connected person is presumed to have known that the information was not generally available and might have a material effect` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 218(4) the connected person is presumed to have known that the information was not generally available and might have a material effect` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
