-- s 220(1) the prosecution or claimant must prove that the accused or defendant intended to use the information in contravention
#ASSERT `s 220(1) the prosecution or claimant must prove that the accused or defendant intended to use the information in contravention` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(1) the prosecution or claimant must prove that the accused or defendant intended to use the information in contravention` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 220(2) the prosecution or claimant must prove the absence of facts that would preclude the act from being a contravention by virtue of sections 222 to 230
#ASSERT `s 220(2) the prosecution or claimant must prove the absence of facts that would preclude the act from being a contravention by virtue of sections 222 to 230` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 220(2) the prosecution or claimant must prove the absence of facts that would preclude the act from being a contravention by virtue of sections 222 to 230` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 221(1) the penalty on conviction for contravening section 218 or 219
#ASSERT `s 221(1) the penalty on conviction for contravening section 218 or 219` EQUALS (Penalty OF 250000, 84, TRUE, 0)

-- s 221(1) the person is guilty of an offence
#ASSERT `s 221(1) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 221(1) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING  -- S
#ASSERT `s 221(1) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 221(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred
#ASSERT `s 221(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 221(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 221(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 218(2) the connected person must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 218(2) the connected person must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "the connected person") DOES `s 218(2) subscribe for, purchase or sell the securities, contracts or units, or enter into an agreement to, or procure another person to, while connected to the corporation and in possession of inside information` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 218(2) the connected person must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 218(3) the connected person must not communicate the inside information to a person likely to deal
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 218(3) the connected person must not communicate the inside information to a person likely to deal` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "the connected person") DOES `s 218(3) communicate, or cause to be communicated, inside information to another person who would be likely to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or procure a third person to` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 218(3) the connected person must not communicate the inside information to a person likely to deal` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 219(2) the insider must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 219(2) the insider must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "the insider") DOES `s 219(2) subscribe for, purchase or sell the securities, contracts or units, or enter into an agreement to, or procure another person to, while in possession of inside information as an insider` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 219(2) the insider must not deal in, or procure dealing in, the securities while in possession of inside information` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

