#TRACE `s 219(3) the insider must not communicate the inside information to a person likely to deal` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "the insider") DOES `s 219(3) communicate, or cause to be communicated, inside information to another person who would be likely to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or procure a third person to` AT 1
